    narr:narration """This hub tracks the evolution of [decision capture as a core product differentiator](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture), established in March 2026. By late July 2026, the focus shifted toward [sprint-level delivery accounting](narr:Position_Sprint4DeliveryAccounting), moving from the conceptual definition of the feature to concrete operational metrics. Recent updates detail the [shipping of the async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785234059251_1) alongside performance data, specifically noting a [velocity of 23 points](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785234059251_2) and the [Zephyr integration](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785234059251_3) as the primary technical catalyst for this output. The trajectory reflects a transition from high-level product strategy to the granular validation of that strategy through team velocity and integration milestones.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785234059251_1> ;
